<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Kleinwort picks Euro stocks for 97.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Kleinwort picks Euro stocks for 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategists at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson on Tuesday named 10 continental European stocks they expect to outperform during 1997.</p>
<p>The ten were Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn, Preussag, Societe Generale, Amer, Kuoni, Nedlloyd, Elsevier, Repsol, EVN and Sulzer.</p>
<p>Further details on reasons for the selection were not immediately available. Last week Kleinwort rolled out a list of ten UK stocks it expects to outperform in the year ahead.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
